    <meta name="atlas.prompt" content="A grand old library reading room in late afternoon: floor-to-ceiling dark walnut bookcases packed with leather-bound books along both long walls, two rows of pale limestone columns, long oak reading tables with benches and brass lamps with green glass shades, a large antique terrestrial globe on a turned wooden pedestal in the centre, three tall windows in the far wall with warm sun coming through, panelled double doors at the other end, herringbone parquet floor, dark timber ceiling beams, architectural interior photograph, sharp focus"/>
